'''Dwarven O's Block Bran''' are a {{Rare}} [[Consumable]].

== Obtaining ==
'''Dwarven O's Block Bran''' has a {{Green|10%}} chance to drop when killing {{MobSprite|Scatha}}s.

== Usage ==
'''Dwarven O's Block Bran''' can be consumed up to {{Green|5}} times. Each '''Dwarven O's Block Bran''' eaten permanently increases the player's {{Stat|bf}} by {{Stat|bf|+2|icononly=yes}}, up to {{Stat|bf|+10}}.

